Package: VariantStoryBench
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible Variant Reanalysis Benchmarks
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
      "Sounkou Mahamane", "Toure",
      email = "sounkoutoure@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")
    )
Description: Generates small synthetic GRCh38 cases and latent truth, accepts
    declared engine result relations, and calculates explicit-denominator
    metrics for rare-disease variant prioritisation benchmarks. The package
    supports deterministic VCF fixtures, canonical 'ducksemantics' HPO
    observations, and 'targets' orchestration for repeatable benchmark runs.
